          "label": "Sync failed",
          "value": "<p>The DataXray classifications sync could not complete.</p><p><b>Reason:</b> {{dxrErrorMessage}}</p><p>DataXray is reached through the Edge HTTP connection configured on this workflow. If the connection name, its host or its credentials are wrong, an administrator can fix them on the Edge site (Settings → Edge) or on the workflow's settings page. Full detail is in <code>dgc.log</code>. Click <b>Send</b> to close this task.</p>",
